# Keep context usable for full-tree Dockerfiles (.devops/cpu.Dockerfile, rknpu2.Dockerfile).
# Do not ignore build/: [.devops/rknn.Dockerfile](.devops/rknn.Dockerfile) copies host-built binaries from build/.
# In-container builds remove a stale build/ tree before cmake (see rknpu2.Dockerfile).

.git/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
